<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HogarFin — Finanzas del Hogar</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2.39.0/dist/umd/supabase.min.js"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,600;0,9..40,700;1,9..40,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <script>
    tailwind.config = {
        theme: {
            extend: {
                colors: {
                    bg: '#0F0F0F',
                    surface: '#1A1A1A',
                    card: '#252525',
                    cardhover: '#2E2E2E',
                    brd: '#353535',
                    muted: '#888888',
                    income: '#00D68F',
                    expense: '#FF6B6B',
                    accent: '#FFB800',
                    accenthover: '#E5A600',
                },
                fontFamily: {
                    display: ['Space Grotesk', 'sans-serif'],
                    body: ['DM Sans', 'sans-serif'],
                }
            }
        }
    }
    </script>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; background: #0F0F0F; color: #F0F0F0; }
        h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #1A1A1A; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #353535; border-radius: 3px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #555; }
        .view { display: none; }
        .view.active { display: block; }
        @keyframes slideUp { from { transform: translateY(20px); opacity: 0; } to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; } }
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
        @keyframes toastIn { from { transform: translateX(100%); opacity: 0; } to { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; } }
        @keyframes toastOut { from { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; } to { transform: translateX(100%); opacity: 0; } }
        .animate-slide-up { animation: slideUp 0.4s ease-out; }
        .animate-fade-in { animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-out; }
        .card-hover { transition: all 0.2s ease; }
        .card-hover:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        .nav-item { transition: all 0.2s ease; position: relative; }
        .nav-item.active { color: #FFB800; }
        .nav-item.active::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); width: 3px; height: 60%; background: #FFB800; border-radius: 0 3px 3px 0; }
        .fab { transition: all 0.3s ease; }
        .fab:hover { transform: scale(1.1) rotate(90deg); }
        .cat-btn { transition: all 0.15s ease; }
        .cat-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.08); }
        .modal-overlay { backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
        .toast { animation: toastIn 0.3s ease-out forwards; }
        .toast.removing { animation: toastOut 0.3s ease-in forwards; }
        .stat-card { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .stat-card::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; right: -50%; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none; }
        .glow-income { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 214, 143, 0.08); }
        .glow-expense { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.08); }
        .glow-accent { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.08); }
        input[type="number"]::-webkit-inner-spin-button,
        input[type="number"]::-webkit-outer-spin-button { -webkit-appearance: none; }
        input[type="number"] { -moz-appearance: textfield; }
        .bg-pattern {
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 25% 25%, rgba(255,184,0,0.03) 0%, transparent 50%),
                              radial-gradient(circle at 75% 75%, rgba(0,214,143,0.03) 0%, transparent 50%);
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .sidebar { transform: translateX(-100%); position: fixed; z-index: 50; }
            .sidebar.open { transform: translateX(0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-bg min-h-screen">

    <!-- ============ OVERLAY DE CONFIGURACIÓN INICIAL ============ -->
    <div id="setup-overlay" class="fixed inset-0 z-[100] bg-bg flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="max-w-lg w-full animate-slide-up">
            <div class="text-center mb-8">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-accent/10 mb-4">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-wallet text-accent text-2xl"></i>
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold mb-2">HogarFin</h1>
                <p class="text-muted">Finanzas compartidas, metas en común</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-surface rounded-2xl p-6 border border-brd mb-4">
                <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-database text-accent"></i> Configurar Supabase
                </h3>

                <!-- Paso 1: SQL -->
                <div class="bg-accent/5 border border-accent/20 rounded-xl p-4 mb-5">
                    <p class="text-sm font-medium mb-2 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-1 text-accent"></i> Ejecuta este SQL en tu Supabase</p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-3">Ve a <strong>SQL Editor</strong> en tu proyecto y pega esto:</p>
                    <div class="bg-bg rounded-lg p-3 text-xs font-mono text-muted overflow-x-auto border border-brd relative">
                        <pre id="sql-code">CREATE TABLE transactions (
  id UUID DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,
  user_name TEXT NOT NULL,
  type TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (type IN ('income','expense')),
  category TEXT NOT NULL,
  amount NUMERIC(12,2) NOT NULL,
  description TEXT DEFAULT '',
  date DATE NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
);

ALTER TABLE transactions ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
CREATE POLICY "Acceso total" ON transactions
  FOR ALL USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);</pre>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="copySQL()" class="mt-2 text-xs text-accent hover:text-accenthover transition flex items-center gap-1">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> Copiar SQL
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Paso 2: Nombres -->
                <div class="bg-income/5 border border-income/20 rounded-xl p-4 mb-5">
                    <p class="text-sm font-medium mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-2 text-income"></i> Nombres de ustedes</p>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                        <div>
                            <label class="text-xs text-muted block mb-1">Persona 1</label>
                            <input id="setup-user1" type="text" value="Él" class="w-full bg-bg border border-brd rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-accent focus:outline-none transition">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="text-xs text-muted block mb-1">Persona 2</label>
                            <input id="setup-user2" type="text" value="Ella" class="w-full bg-bg border border-brd rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-accent focus:outline-none transition">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Info de conexión (ya embebida) -->
                <div class="bg-bg/50 rounded-xl p-3 flex items-center gap-3">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-income text-sm"></i>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-income font-medium">Supabase preconfigurado</p>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-muted">mzdmpurmudvysnjylrik.supabase.co</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <button onclick="connectAndStart()" class="w-full bg-accent hover:bg-accenthover text-bg font-bold py-3.5 rounded-xl transition mb-3 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-rocket"></i> Comenzar
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ============ APP PRINCIPAL ============ -->
    <div id="app" class="hidden">
        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <aside id="sidebar" class="sidebar fixed left-0 top-0 h-full w-64 bg-surface border-r border-brd flex flex-col z-40 transition-transform duration-300">
            <div class="p-5 border-b border-brd">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-wallet text-accent text-sm"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-lg">HogarFin</h2>
                </div>
            </div>
            <nav class="flex-1 p-3 space-y-1">
                <button onclick="navigate('dashboard')" class="nav-item active w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm" data-nav="dashboard">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie w-5 text-center"></i> Panel
                </button>
                <button onclick="navigate('transactions')" class="nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm text-muted hover:text-white" data-nav="transactions">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-list w-5 text-center"></i> Transacciones
                </button>
                <button onclick="navigate('analytics')" class="nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm text-muted hover:text-white" data-nav="analytics">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line w-5 text-center"></i> Analíticas
                </button>
                <button onclick="navigate('settings')" class="nav-item w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm text-muted hover:text-white" data-nav="settings">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gear w-5 text-center"></i> Ajustes
                </button>
            </nav>
            <div class="p-4 border-t border-brd">
                <div id="sidebar-users" class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"></div>
                <div id="sync-status" class="text-xs text-muted flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-muted"></span> Conectando...
                </div>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- Main -->
        <main class="md:ml-64 min-h-screen bg-pattern">
            <!-- Header mobile -->
            <header class="md:hidden sticky top-0 z-30 bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-lg border-b border-brd px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                <button onclick="toggleSidebar()" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-card flex items-center justify-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bars text-sm"></i>
                </button>
                <h2 class="font-display font-bold">HogarFin</h2>
                <button onclick="openAddModal()" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-accent text-sm"></i>
                </button>
            </header>

            <!-- ===== DASHBOARD ===== -->
            <div id="view-dashboard" class="view active p-4 md:p-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                    <div>
                        <h1 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold">Panel</h1>
                        <p class="text-muted text-sm" id="dash-subtitle"></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <button onclick="changeMonth(-1)" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-card hover:bg-cardhover border border-brd flex items-center justify-center transition">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left text-xs"></i>
                        </button>
                        <span id="month-label" class="text-sm font-medium min-w-[140px] text-center"></span>
                        <button onclick="changeMonth(1)" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-card hover:bg-cardhover border border-brd flex items-center justify-center transition">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-xs"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 md:gap-4 mb-6">
                    <div class="stat-card bg-card rounded-xl p-4 border border-brd glow-accent">
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-1 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced"></i> Balance</p>
                        <p id="stat-balance" class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-display font-bold text-accent">$0</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card bg-card rounded-xl p-4 border border-brd glow-income">
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-1 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up"></i> Ingresos</p>
                        <p id="stat-income" class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-display font-bold text-income">$0</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card bg-card rounded-xl p-4 border border-brd glow-expense">
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-1 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-down"></i> Gastos</p>
                        <p id="stat-expense" class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-display font-bold text-expense">$0</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card bg-card rounded-xl p-4 border border-brd">
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-1 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-piggy-bank"></i> Ahorro</p>
                        <p id="stat-savings" class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-display font-bold">$0</p>
                        <p id="stat-savings-pct" class="text-xs text-muted mt-0.5">0% del ingreso</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4 md:gap-6 mb-6">
                    <div class="lg:col-span-3 bg-card rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5 border border-brd">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-sm">Ingreso vs Gasto</h3>
                        <canvas id="chart-trend" height="200"></canvas>
                    </div>
                    <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-card rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5 border border-brd">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-sm">Gastos por categoría</h3>
                        <canvas id="chart-categories" height="200"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-6">
                    <div class="bg-card rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5 border border-brd">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-sm">Contribución por persona</h3>
                        <div id="user-breakdown" class="space-y-3"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-card rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5 border border-brd">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                            <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-sm">Últimos movimientos</h3>
                            <button onclick="navigate('transactions')" class="text-xs text-accent hover:text-accenthover transition">Ver todos <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i></button>
                        </div>
                        <div id="recent-transactions" class="space-y-2"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== TRANSACCIONES ===== -->
            <div id="view-transactions" class="view p-4 md:p-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                    <h1 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold">Transacciones</h1>
                    <button onclick="openAddModal()" class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accenthover text-bg font-semibold py-2.5 px-5 rounded-xl transition text-sm">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Nueva
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
                    <select id="filter-type" onchange="renderTransactions()" class="bg-card border border-brd rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-accent focus:outline-none">
                        <option value="all">Todos</option>
                        <option value="income">Ingresos</option>
                        <option value="expense">Gastos</option>
                    </select>
                    <select id="filter-user" onchange="renderTransactions()" class="bg-card border border-brd rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-accent focus:outline-none">
                        <option value="all">Ambos</option>
                    </select>
                    <select id="filter-category" onchange="renderTransactions()" class="bg-card border border-brd rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-accent focus:outline-none">
                        <option value="all">Categorías</option>
                    </select>
                    <input id="filter-search" oninput="renderTransactions()" type="text" placeholder="Buscar..." class="bg-card border border-brd rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-accent focus:outline-none w-40">
                </div>
                <div id="transactions-list" class="space-y-2"></div>
                <div id="transactions-empty" class="hidden text-center py-16 text-muted">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-receipt text-4xl mb-3 opacity-30"></i>
                    <p>No hay transacciones</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== ANALÍTICAS ===== -->
            <div id="view-analytics" class="view p-4 md:p-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
                <h1 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-6">Analíticas</h1>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-6 mb-6">
                    <div class="bg-card rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5 border border-brd">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-sm">Tendencia mensual (6 meses)</h3>
                        <canvas id="chart-monthly" height="220"></canvas>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-card rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5 border border-brd">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-sm">Distribución de gastos</h3>
                        <canvas id="chart-donut" height="220"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-6">
                    <div class="bg-card rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5 border border-brd">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-sm">Comparativa por persona</h3>
                        <canvas id="chart-users" height="220"></canvas>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-card rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5 border border-brd">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-sm">Top categorías de gasto</h3>
                        <div id="top-categories" class="space-y-3"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ===== AJUSTES ===== -->
            <div id="view-settings" class="view p-4 md:p-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                <h1 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-6">Ajustes</h1>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="bg-card rounded-xl p-5 border border-brd">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4">Supabase</h3>
                        <div id="settings-supabase" class="space-y-3"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-card rounded-xl p-5 border border-brd">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4">Nombres</h3>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                            <div>
                                <label class="text-sm text-muted block mb-1">Persona 1</label>
                                <input id="settings-user1" type="text" class="w-full bg-bg border border-brd rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-accent focus:outline-none">
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label class="text-sm text-muted block mb-1">Persona 2</label>
                                <input id="settings-user2" type="text" class="w-full bg-bg border border-brd rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-accent focus:outline-none">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="saveUserNames()" class="mt-3 bg-accent hover:bg-accenthover text-bg text-sm font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition">Guardar</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-card rounded-xl p-5 border border-brd">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4">Moneda</h3>
                        <select id="settings-currency" onchange="saveCurrency()" class="bg-bg border border-brd rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-accent focus:outline-none w-48">
                            <option value="USD">USD ($)</option>
                            <option value="EUR">EUR (€)</option>
                            <option value="MXN">MXN ($)</option>
                            <option value="ARS">ARS ($)</option>
                            <option value="COP">COP ($)</option>
                            <option value="CLP">CLP ($)</option>
                            <option value="PEN">PEN (S/)</option>
                            <option value="UYU">UYU (U$)</option>
                            <option value="BRL">BRL (R$)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-card rounded-xl p-5 border border-brd">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-4 text-expense">Zona peligrosa</h3>
                        <button onclick="exportData()" class="bg-surface hover:bg-cardhover border border-brd text-sm py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition mr-2 mb-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-download mr-1"></i> Exportar JSON
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="clearAllData()" class="bg-expense/10 hover:bg-expense/20 text-expense text-sm py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition mb-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-trash mr-1"></i> Borrar todo
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>

        <!-- FAB mobile -->
        <button onclick="openAddModal()" class="fab md:hidden fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-30 w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-accent shadow-lg shadow-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-bg text-lg"></i>
        </button>
    </div>

    <!-- ============ MODAL AGREGAR ============ -->
    <div id="modal-add" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden">
        <div class="modal-overlay absolute inset-0 bg-black/60" onclick="closeAddModal()"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 md:bottom-auto md:top-1/2 md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2 md:-translate-y-1/2 w-full md:max-w-md bg-surface rounded-t-2xl md:rounded-2xl border border-brd animate-slide-up overflow-y-auto max-h-[90vh]">
            <div class="p-5">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
                    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-lg">Nueva transacción</h2>
                    <button onclick="closeAddModal()" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-card hover:bg-cardhover flex items-center justify-center transition">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-sm"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-2 mb-5">
                    <button onclick="setModalType('expense')" id="btn-type-expense" class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition bg-expense/10 text-expense border-2 border-expense">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-minus mr-1"></i> Gasto
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="setModalType('income')" id="btn-type-income" class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition bg-card text-muted border-2 border-transparent">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-plus mr-1"></i> Ingreso
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="mb-4">
                    <label class="text-sm text-muted block mb-1">Monto</label>
                    <input id="modal-amount" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="0.00" class="w-full bg-bg border border-brd rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-2xl font-display font-bold focus:border-accent focus:outline-none transition text-center">
                </div>
                <div class="mb-4">
                    <label class="text-sm text-muted block mb-2">Categoría</label>
                    <div id="modal-categories" class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="mb-4">
